  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n45 ∶ 15 ∶∶ 20 ∶ 10 ∶∶ 125 ∶ ?\n\n**Logic:** First no. = [(Second no.)² ÷ 5]\n\n**45 : 15 →**\n\n⇒ [(15)² ÷ 5]\n\n⇒ (225 ÷ 5) = 45\n\n**20 : 10 →**\n\n⇒ [(10)2 ÷ 5]\n\n⇒ (100 ÷ 5) = 20\n\nSimilarly, for '125 : ?' →\n\n⇒ [(Y)2 ÷ 5] = 125\n\n⇒ (Y)² = (125 × 5)\n\n⇒ (Y)2 = 625\n\n⇒ **Y = 25**\n\nHere, **'125 : 25'** is the correct pair.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (2)\".\n\n58:Ta3d,\n<",
